flowchart TB
accTitle: Optimize the two measured latency sources
accDescr: Static assets are served from edge caches while repeated flight queries use a versioned result cache. Publishing a new data version changes the query cache namespace.
U[Global browser]:::external -->|Static asset request| E[CloudFront edge cache]:::storage
E -->|Cache miss| S[(S3 versioned assets)]:::storage
U -->|Flight data request| W[Regional web tier]:::process
W --> C{Current-version result cached?}:::decision
C -->|Yes| R[Return result]:::output
C -->|No| D[(RDS flight data)]:::storage
D -->|App caches query result| K[(ElastiCache query results)]:::storage
K --> R
P[Publish next data version]:::inputData -.->|New cache-key version| C
